  "remarks": "PJSC Slavneft is a Russian company active in the energy sector. PJSC Slavneft engages in oil and gas extraction and refining. The energy sector, especially the oil and gas sectors, provides a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation. Therefore, PJSC Slavneft is involved in an economic sector providing a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation, which is responsible for the annexation of Crimea and the destabilisation of Ukraine.",
